From 0163b84020bfef1326ad7f47bcfecb31c4869fd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Goulven Riou <goulven.riou@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:32:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(filesr): keep CBT chain usable after vdi_revert

Rebuild dest's CBT log from the chain instead of resetting it (fixes 460).

Signed-off-by: Goulven Riou <goulven.riou@vates.tech>
Signed-off-by: Antoine Bartuccio <antoine.bartuccio@vates.tech>
---
 drivers/FileSR.py | 102 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 drivers/VDI.py    |  75 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 drivers/util.py   |   4 ++
 3 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 56 deletions(-)

